    "name_en": "Wyrmcraft Sword",
    "name_es": "Espada Wyrmcraft",
    "desc_en": "This sword once belonged to Sir Grizzlefang, famous for his impressive swordplay - and, well, his less-than-impressive aim. Forged in the fires of a dragon’s breath, it carries a legacy. Lucky for you, though, we’ve managed to leave out the smell.",
    "desc_es": "Esta espada perteneció a Sir Grizzlefang, famoso por su impresionante manejo de la espada y, bueno, por su puntería menos que impresionante. Forjada en el fuego del aliento de un dragón, carga un legado. Por suerte, hemos logrado eliminar el olor.",
    "furn_name_es": "Espada Wyrmcraft",
    "furn_name_en": "Wyrmcraft Sword",
